&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Working Student to support our Customer Success team in DACH. In this role, you will work closely with our Customer Success Managers, helping ensure our customers get the insights they need to succeed in their business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be part of a team that is shaping the future of market research and consumer insights, while gaining valuable hands-on experience and building a strong foundation for a future career in Customer Success, Account Management, or Sales at one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing companies.&lt;/p&gt;
