&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Talent Brand Manager, you&#39;ll shape how current and prospective team members understand what it means to work at GitLab. You&#39;ll bring our employer value proposition to life through talent brand strategy, recruitment marketing, and integrated campaigns across the candidate journey. You&#39;ll combine editorial judgment, performance data, cross-functional influence, and artificial intelligence tools to create clear, inclusive, and authentic candidate experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Lead GitLab&#39;s talent brand strategy, translating our employer value proposition and company direction into clear, differentiated candidate messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Design integrated campaigns and build scalable content systems, recruiter resources, reporting, event support, and campaign operations across careers content, social media, employer review platforms, talent communities, events, and recruiter channels, using technology and artificial intelligence tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Set editorial direction and align cross-functional partners and contributors on authentic stories featuring team members, leaders, teams, culture, values, career growth, and the impact of working at GitLab, ensuring accurate, inclusive, culturally relevant, and consistent talent brand work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Advise Talent Acquisition and business leaders on audience strategy and campaigns that support hiring priorities, candidate pipelines, and conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Improve candidate journey touchpoints so candidates receive transparent, consistent, and relevant information throughout the hiring process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Use performance data, audience insights, candidate feedback, and talent market and channel trends to set priorities, evaluate results, recommend new approaches, and communicate impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Significant experience in talent brand, employer brand, or recruitment marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Experience developing and leading brand or recruitment marketing strategies across multiple audiences, regions, or hiring priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Strong storytelling, writing, editing, and editorial judgment across multiple channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Experience leading complex campaigns with multiple stakeholders, deadlines, budgets, or external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Strong analytical judgment and experience using data, audience insights, feedback, and research to improve outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Ability to influence senior stakeholders, create structure from ambiguity, and move between strategy and execution in an asynchronous environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Talent Brand team sits within GitLab&#39;s People Group and partners with Talent Acquisition, Marketing, Corporate Communications, Social Media, Diversity, Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging, and leaders across GitLab. In this role, you&#39;ll help set the team&#39;s direction, strengthen GitLab&#39;s employer narrative and regional presence, support hiring priorities, improve candidate experiences, and use data to extend the impact of a small, focused team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The base salary range for this role’s listed level is currently for residents of the&amp;nbsp;United States only. This range is intended to reflect the role&#39;s base salary rate in locations throughout the US.&amp;nbsp;Grade level and salary ranges are determined through interviews and a review of education, experience, knowledge, skills, abilities of the applicant, equity with other team members, alignment with market data,&amp;nbsp;and geographic location.&amp;nbsp;The base salary range does not include any bonuses, equity, or benefits. See more information on our &lt;a class=&quot;waffle-rich-text-link&quot; href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-link=&quot;https://bit.ly/GLBeneUS&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#1155cc;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;font-family:&#39;&#39;Arial&#39;&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;benefits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;Arial&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;waffle-rich-text-link&quot; href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/stock-options/&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-link=&quot;https://bit.ly/GLequity&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#1155cc;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;font-family:&#39;&#39;Arial&#39;&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;equity&lt;/a&gt;. Sales roles are also eligible for incentive pay targeted at up to 100% of the offered base salary.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;United States Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$115,200&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$194,400 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;page&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;layoutArea&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;column&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Ogilvy Health, we work with ambitious healthcare brands to create work that makes a meaningful difference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Account Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join us, working on an exciting global respiratory account. This is a brilliant opportunity for someone ready for real ownership. You’ll have the autonomy to run the account day to day, build a strong relationship with the client and play a leading role in where the partnership goes next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be joining a supportive team, but there’s plenty of space to make the account your own. With a strong pipeline of work ahead and a growing client relationship, you’ll have genuine visibility and the opportunity to make an impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll gain further global experience, work across campaign launches and major congress activity, and have a senior team around you when you need it, while still being trusted to lead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re a Senior Account Manager looking for a role where you can &lt;strong&gt;step up, have a voice and genuinely make an account your own&lt;/strong&gt;, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll take the lead on the day-to-day running of the account, working closely with the client and wider Ogilvy team to keep everything moving in the right direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There’s a great mix of work to get involved in, from taking an established US campaign and helping bring it to global markets, to developing market toolkits, promotional materials and supporting major congress activity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be responsible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading the day-to-day client relationship and becoming a trusted partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership of the account and keeping priorities, projects and teams moving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading global campaign work, including adapting and rolling out campaign materials across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overseeing the development of promotional materials and communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with strategy, creative, medical and project management teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Playing a leading role in major congress activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spotting opportunities to strengthen and grow the client relationship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting and developing more junior members of the account team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bringing confidence, good judgement and a collaborative approach to everything you do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What You’ll Need&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll already have good experience gained at the Account Manager level within a healthcare communications agency, ideally working with prescription pharmaceutical brands and global accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’d particularly love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Rx/pharmaceutical healthcare communications experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on global campaigns and launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence managing senior day-to-day client relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good understanding of promotional work and the pharmaceutical environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating work across different markets and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The confidence to lead an account and make decisions without needing lots of direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial instincts and an interest in helping an account grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, low-ego approach to leadership&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;How We’ll Support You&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ogilvy celebrates its people. Fully. Enthusiastically. Unhesitatingly. We’ll empower you with the tools you’ll need to succeed. We’ll give you the autonomy to seek out new paths and better ways of doing things. We’ll support you with colleagues who are experts in their disciplines, drawn from across the Ogilvy network. And we’ll provide opportunities for you to do work of which you’ll be proud, with people you’ll be proud to call your teammates.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days’ annual leave, increasing to 30 days with service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your birthday and Christmas off, plus one volunteer day per year&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working, with core hours of 10am–4pm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from anywhere in the UK for up to four weeks each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bupa healthcare, including access to a virtual GP and second opinion service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced pension contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health counselling and wider wellbeing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly contribution towards fitness and lifestyle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On-demand learning, development and professional coaching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced family-friendly policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance and income protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Our ambition is to attract the very best diverse talent to Ogilvy, and to be the employer of choice in the UK. We want everyone to feel welcome when they join us, and once they’re here, for them to want to stay with us, grow their career, and to feel they belong with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNoSpacing&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and we’re committed to creating an inclusive, welcoming environment for everyone who wants to work at Ogilvy. For us, diversity, equity and inclusion is integrated into everything that we do. We believe that for creativity to flourish, everything about how we work must have diversity at its core. Your race, colour, ethnic, religion, gender, gender identity, national origin, sexual orientation, age, marital status, disability, have no bearing on our hiring decisions, but we encourage everyone to feel free to express their true selves in an environment we are consistently striving to make as inclusive as possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNoSpacing&quot;&gt;We aim to facilitate an accessible and positive application experience for all candidates. If you require any adjustments from us to support you through the process or expect to require any adjustments to working conditions to be able to best perform in the role, please let us know. We are happy to consider all reasonable adjustments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNoSpacing&quot;&gt;If you live with a disability and you would like to take advantage of our offer of a guaranteed interview under the Disability Confident Scheme, please ensure you fill out our voluntary Equal Opportunities Questionnaire when applying.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Host Broadcast Services (HBS) is a leading, independent host broadcast specialist, dedicated to helping international sports federations, organising committees, and rights holders deliver their events to a global audience. We provide world-class broadcast solutions for some of the world’s biggest sporting events, including the prestigious FIFA World Cup™, ensuring broadcasters worldwide can offer fans a unique and engaging viewing experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Zug, Switzerland, and as part of the Infront Sports &amp;amp; Media group, HBS offers the full spectrum of host broadcast operations and services — combining technological innovation with deep industry expertise to set the benchmark in live sports broadcasting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✨ HR Senior Manager Compensation &amp;amp; Systems – France&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍 Paris, France | CDI&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HBS is looking for an experienced Compensation &amp;amp; Systems Manager to lead the development and delivery of our global reward, benefits and HR systems strategy across an international organisation operating in a fast-paced, project-driven environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior HR role with broad international exposure, combining strategic reward management with operational delivery and HR systems oversight. Working closely with HR leadership, Finance and business stakeholders globally, you will play a key role in ensuring our compensation and benefits programmes remain competitive, compliant and aligned with business objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;implement&amp;nbsp;global&amp;nbsp;compensation&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;benefits&amp;nbsp;strategies&amp;nbsp;aligned&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;business&amp;nbsp;goals&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;market&amp;nbsp;trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead&amp;nbsp;salary&amp;nbsp;benchmarking,&amp;nbsp;pay&amp;nbsp;analysis&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;job&amp;nbsp;evaluation&amp;nbsp;processes&amp;nbsp;across&amp;nbsp;multiple&amp;nbsp;regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage&amp;nbsp;annual&amp;nbsp;compensation&amp;nbsp;review&amp;nbsp;cycles,&amp;nbsp;including&amp;nbsp;salary&amp;nbsp;increases,&amp;nbsp;promotions&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;bonus&amp;nbsp;allocations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee&amp;nbsp;global&amp;nbsp;employee&amp;nbsp;benefits&amp;nbsp;programmes,&amp;nbsp;wellness&amp;nbsp;initiatives&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;vendor&amp;nbsp;relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure&amp;nbsp;compliance&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;local&amp;nbsp;labour&amp;nbsp;laws,&amp;nbsp;tax&amp;nbsp;regulations&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;reporting&amp;nbsp;requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse&amp;nbsp;compensation&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;benefits&amp;nbsp;data&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;provide&amp;nbsp;strategic&amp;nbsp;recommendations&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;cost&amp;nbsp;efficiencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;internal&amp;nbsp;stakeholders&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;communicate&amp;nbsp;reward&amp;nbsp;programmes&amp;nbsp;effectively&amp;nbsp;across&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HR Systems (HRIS)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;optimisation,&amp;nbsp;maintenance&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;development&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;HRIS&amp;nbsp;platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure&amp;nbsp;accuracy&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;integrity&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;employee&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;compensation&amp;nbsp;data&amp;nbsp;globally&lt;/li&gt;
