&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;7. Our Hiring Process&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;We warmly encourage you to apply to any of our roles, even if you think you&#39;re not an exact match.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Please click the &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;&quot;Apply&quot;&lt;/strong&gt; button to submit your application — this helps us make the best possible assessment and get back to you as quickly as possible.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-decimal pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Manual screening of your CV&lt;/strong&gt; by a recruiter, followed by an &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;AI-powered screening conversation (10 min) with Emma&lt;/strong&gt;, Mirakl&#39;s AI Talent Ambassador, to explore your background and motivation for the role. You will need to complete this step within &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;3 days&lt;/strong&gt;, otherwise we won&#39;t be able to move forward with your application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;30-minute Talent Acquisition interview&lt;/strong&gt; with Heather Decoudun&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Interview with Jonathan D&#39;Elissagaray&lt;/strong&gt;, Director of Solution Consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Values interview&lt;/strong&gt; with a trained Mirakl interviewer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We welcome collaborators with their diverse perspectives and experiences to power us forward. These often far exceed conventional job requirements and help us create a culture of continuous learning. If you’re ready to join a global leader powering digital transformation for 450+ of the world’s most innovative retailers and B2B organizations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As part of our recruitment process, Mirakl processes your personal data to review and manage your application and, where appropriate, to consider your profile for future opportunities. You can exercise your data protection rights at any time, and as further detailed in our policies. For more information about how we process your personal data and your rights, please consult our Recruitment Privacy Notice, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mirakl.com/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; in English and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mirakl.com/fr-FR/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; in French.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We may use Artificial Intelligence (AI) solutions to help streamline our hiring process, including screening applications, analyzing resumes, and assessing responses. While AI helps us work efficiently, all final hiring decisions are made by humans. For more information, visit our &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://info.mirakl.com/ai-guidelines-for-candidates-and-interviews&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI Guidelines for Candidates and Interviews&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;: Berlin, Barcelona or London!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Lyft, our purpose is to serve and connect. We aim to achieve this by cultivating a work environment where all team members belong and have the opportunity to thrive.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The autonomous transition is a transformational opportunity for Lyft. Our strategy focuses on becoming the preferred marketplace, fleet, and operational partner for the world&#39;s best Autonomous Vehicle (AV) providers. As AV services begin launching across Europe, the programs that govern our partnerships, from pre-launch planning through ongoing operations, become a critical foundation for sustainable growth. This role sits at the center of that work, owning the end-to-end management of our autonomous partnership programs and serving as the primary face of Lyft to our external partners.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You have experience managing complex, multi-stakeholder programs with external partners or customers. You are a skilled communicator who can represent Lyft externally with credibility and care, while bringing together a wide range of internal teams. You enjoy combining strategic relationship management with hands-on operational rigor, and you know how to stay close to the details without losing sight of the bigger picture. You’re curious, proactive and comfortable working in a new space where processes are still being built.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR DAILY ADVENTURES WILL INCLUDE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own program management end-to-end, from launch planning through ongoing operations, including creating launch plans, driving internal alignment on milestones and deliverables, managing workstream trackers, and ensuring quality of deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary external point of contact for partners, leading regular syncs, managing day-to-day communications, and building the trusted relationships needed to navigate complex programs and surface issues proactively over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the central hub across cross-functional internal teams supporting the program; drive alignment on priorities and decisions, escalate issues with the right context, and be accountable for resolution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor program health and performance on a regular cadence; lead structured deep dives on customer experience, operational quality, and other key areas; present findings and share data and insights internally and with partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive program optimization and manage the joint roadmap with partners, own the project intake process, gather requirements and impact sizing from partners, coordinate prioritization across internal teams, and ensure execution against agreed commitments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and address gaps in processes, partner experience, or operational execution, proactively flagging risks and driving continuous improvement across the program lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO BE SUCCESSFUL IN THIS ROLE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Typically 5+ years of experience in program management, relationship management, product operations, or a related field, with demonstrated experience in complex, multi-team environments and externally-facing programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience serving as a face of the company externally, managing partner or customer relationships with professionalism and sound judgment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong program management skills, with the ability to run multiple structured workstreams simultaneously across a wide range of stakeholders without losing sight of the details&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills; comfortable preparing materials for and presenting to senior internal and external audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing joint roadmaps, intake processes, or cross-functional prioritization frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate ambiguity and operate effectively in a fast-moving environment where priorities and processes continue to evolve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the AV, automotive, or mobility ecosystem is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
